<v Jane Doe>Sure, go ahead.</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-4
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:32.000
<v John Smith>Can you tell me about a time you faced
a difficult technical challenge and how
you approached solving it?</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:38.500
<v Jane Doe>One example that comes to mind is when I was working
on a Python CLI tool that formatted interview transcripts.
I had to figure out how to parse VTT files reliably.</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-6
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:42.000
<v John Smith>That sounds interesting. What was the trickiest part?</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-7
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Jane Doe>Handling the edge cases — multiline speech, Windows line endings,
and making sure adjacent blocks from the same speaker
get merged properly.</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-8
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:52.000
<v John Smith>And how did you validate your solution?</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
<v Jane Doe>I wrote a comprehensive test suite using pytest,
covering all the edge cases I could think of.</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-10
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.000
<v John Smith>Excellent. Thank you for sharing that.</v>

91b3f3c3-44c6-4a8b-8c0a-add105d816bd/32-11
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:02.000
<v Jane Doe>Thank you for the opportunity to interview.</v>
